# Test artifacts
*.pptx
# ...but never the branded master template: it must ship to the deployed
# container. `railway up` honours these patterns, so a bare *.pptx strips it
# from the upload and /generate-report 500s with PackageNotFoundError.
!assets/granuler_template.pptx

